; EXODUS.BIN: Ultima III (Origin 1983, PC version by James R. Van Artsdalen).
; Generated by tools/gen.py; tools/build.py builds it (MASM, LINK, then the image from 0100).
; TOWNS: pub, grocer, temple, weapons, armour, guild, horses (A5AC-ADCA).
;
; The town services. Transact (EQUIP; menus in ACTIONS) finds the merchant's kind and jumps through the
; table ShopCmds (ACTIONS): ShopPub, ShopGrocer, ShopTemple, ShopWeapons, ShopArmour, ShopGuild,
; ShopRadrion, ShopHorses. On entry DI = the record of the player who transacts: he pays, and the
; weapons and armour he buys or sells are his. All prices are packed BCD: PayGold (ENDING, PayGold)
; takes them off the gold at [di+23h] and sets CF when there is not enough. Menus go through the
; library's AskChoice (SI = string pointers, DI = keys, CX = number of keys: AL = the key chosen) and
; AskYesNo (AskYesNo: AL = 'Y' or 'N'). The texts and tables are in TEXT.ASM.
; Sound codes: 0FFh = failure, 0FEh = refused, 0FDh (BL, BH = pitch, length?) = the temple's.
; "Dawn" below: the extra weapons and armours are sold only where the saved position PartyXY
; has x = 25h, i.e. in Dawn (MapPosTbl entry 8, x 37, y 53; see DawnCell in EXDATA).
CODE SEGMENT BYTE PUBLIC
ASSUME CS:CODE, DS:CODE, ES:CODE, SS:CODE
EXTRN PrintDigit:NEAR
EXTRN AskChoice:NEAR
EXTRN ReadNumber:NEAR
EXTRN Sound:NEAR
EXTRN PartyTile:BYTE
EXTRN PartySize:BYTE
EXTRN PartyXY:BYTE
EXTRN ExtraWeaponsOk:BYTE
EXTRN ExtraArmoursOk:BYTE
EXTRN PrintMsg:NEAR
EXTRN ScrollMsg:NEAR
EXTRN AskPlayer:NEAR
EXTRN StatusLine:NEAR
EXTRN WaitMore:NEAR
EXTRN FlashPlayer:NEAR
EXTRN FlashView:NEAR
EXTRN WeaponMenuStrs:BYTE
EXTRN ArmourMenuStrs:BYTE
EXTRN TxtWhat:BYTE
EXTRN ReadAmount:NEAR
EXTRN ShopWeaponKeys:BYTE
EXTRN ShopArmourKeys:BYTE
EXTRN MsgWelcomePub:BYTE
EXTRN MsgHaveADrink:BYTE
EXTRN MsgLeaveMyShop:BYTE
EXTRN MsgCantPay:BYTE
EXTRN MsgAnother:BYTE
EXTRN MsgBeenAPleasure:BYTE
EXTRN PubTips:BYTE
EXTRN MsgGrocer:BYTE
EXTRN MsgGrocerThanks:BYTE
EXTRN MsgTooMuchToCarry:BYTE
EXTRN MsgSacraments:BYTE
EXTRN MsgFareTheeWell:BYTE
EXTRN MsgCuringCost:BYTE
EXTRN MsgTempleCureWhom:BYTE
EXTRN MsgHealingCost:BYTE
EXTRN MsgTempleHealWhom:BYTE
EXTRN MsgResurrectCost:BYTE
EXTRN MsgTempleResurrectWhom:BYTE
EXTRN MsgRecallCost:BYTE
EXTRN MsgTempleRecallWhom:BYTE
EXTRN MsgNoOfferings:BYTE
EXTRN MsgNotGoldEnough:BYTE
EXTRN MsgNotInjured:BYTE
EXTRN MsgTempleFailed:BYTE
EXTRN MsgNotDead:BYTE
EXTRN MsgNotAshes:BYTE
EXTRN TempleCmds:BYTE
EXTRN TempleMenuKeys:BYTE
EXTRN TempleMenuStrs:BYTE
EXTRN BuySellMenuKeys:BYTE
EXTRN BuySellMenuStrs:BYTE
EXTRN MsgWeaponsShop:BYTE
EXTRN MsgBuyOrSell:BYTE
EXTRN MsgYourInterest:BYTE
EXTRN MsgHaventTheGold:BYTE
EXTRN MsgHereYouAre:BYTE
EXTRN MsgForSale:BYTE
EXTRN MsgDontOwn:BYTE
EXTRN MsgThankYou:BYTE
EXTRN MsgWeaponList1:BYTE
EXTRN MsgWeaponList2:BYTE
EXTRN MsgWeaponList3:BYTE
EXTRN MsgWeaponList4:BYTE
EXTRN MsgTooMuchGold:BYTE
EXTRN MsgShopNoMoreRoom:BYTE
EXTRN WeaponPrices:BYTE
EXTRN MsgArmourShop:BYTE
EXTRN MsgArmourList1:BYTE
EXTRN MsgArmourList2:BYTE
EXTRN ArmourPrices:BYTE
EXTRN MsgRadrion:BYTE
EXTRN MsgHowMany100gp:BYTE
EXTRN MsgMoreOffering:BYTE
EXTRN MsgGoodLuck:BYTE
EXTRN OracleVerses:BYTE
EXTRN MsgEquineEmporium:BYTE
EXTRN MsgHorsesCost:BYTE
EXTRN MsgWillYouBuy:BYTE
EXTRN MsgTooBad:BYTE
EXTRN MsgRideFast:BYTE
EXTRN GuildMenuKeys:BYTE
EXTRN GuildMenuStrs:BYTE
EXTRN GuildCmds:BYTE
EXTRN MsgGuildShop:BYTE
EXTRN MsgGuildThanks:BYTE
EXTRN MsgNotTheFunds:BYTE
EXTRN MsgAnythingElse:BYTE
EXTRN MsgGuildHowMany:BYTE
EXTRN AskYesNo:NEAR
EXTRN PayGold:NEAR
PUBLIC ShopPub
PUBLIC ShopGrocer
PUBLIC ShopTemple
PUBLIC TempleCure
PUBLIC TempleHeal
PUBLIC TempleResurrect
PUBLIC TempleRecall
PUBLIC ShopWeapons
PUBLIC ShopArmour
PUBLIC ShopGuild
PUBLIC GuildGems
